  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi></math>-intercepts of the tangents drawn from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the equation of the tangent from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />So, the equations of the tangents are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi></math>-intercepts of the tangents are <math><mn>1</mn></math> &amp; <math><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;the sum of <math><mi>y</mi></math>-intercepts&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
